8,Phangduwali | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/phw/,"Phangduwali is an endangered indigenous language of Nepal. It belongs to the Sino-Tibetan language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by adults only.",Phangduwali,Sino-Tibetan
